{"unit_id":"lixiangdong122333__dsh-notify#card-zh","repo":"lixiangdong122333/dsh-notify","commit":"96dd7954ac89fa8953b9ad3ecfa2e7f64d417362","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"@cmwl1231/dsh-notify 为 DSH 提供 Windows、macOS 桌面通知。Host 监听会话结束和 ask_user_question，通过 Windows WinRT、macOS terminal-notifier 或 osascript 发出提醒；Client 提供通知设置页。用户可选择提醒类型、提问等待时间、正文来源、声音和免打扰条件，也能发送测试通知。适合切换去做其他事情、仍需知道任务完成或助手等候回复的人。需要受支持的系统及通知组件；macOS 点击通知返回 DSH 需要 terminal-notifier。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:254-327","index.js:353-382","index.js:402-499","client.js:633-652","macos.js:125-140"]}
